From 5b36af77c347f8ec9eca4247a179fa6131194ea6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 07:32:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Patch 0201: every frame of the title and save machine menus
 with rows 12 apart is 12 high (MENU_HIGHLIGHTS h 0x0a, as 0194 did for
 OPTIONS): the title menu, NEW GAME / CONTINUE card choices, the Yes / No
 screens, BATTLE MODE, the battle registration and Do you want to save?
 prompts; at 0x0c their bottom line was drawn on the next row's first line of
 letters. The slot list (rows 36 apart) and the dialogue choices (a band that
 touches nothing) keep theirs

---
 src/main/main_menu.c | 34 +++++++++++++++++-----------------
 1 file changed, 17 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

